00:01:33.630 --> 00:01:35.100
Why might you be interested in LinkedIn?

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:37.260
I think there are three reasons for that.

00:01:37.260 --> 00:01:40.170
First, employee recruiting.

00:01:40.170 --> 00:01:42.450
So if an employee wants to find a new job,

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:45.510
that person would likely
look up the firm on LinkedIn.

00:01:45.510 --> 00:01:48.090
And of course, if you
publish regular content,

00:01:48.090 --> 00:01:51.090
that will be very instrumental
for potential candidates

00:01:51.090 --> 00:01:54.540
